  "body": "Fresh, modern, and ready for you to move in! This brand new home offers the perfect balance of comfort, style, and affordability.\r\n\r\nDesigned with practicality in mind, each home features 3 well-sized bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, including a master with its own ensuite, creating a private retreat at the end of the day. The single-level layout makes everyday living effortless, ideal for families of all ages.\r\n\r\nAt the heart of the home, the open-plan living and dining area is bathed in natural light and flows seamlessly to a north-facing deck, where you can enjoy all-day sun-perfect for morning coffee or summer BBQs.\r\n\r\nWhy You'll Love It:\r\n\r\n- Light-filled open plan living\r\n- North-facing outdoor decking\r\n- 3 bedrooms, 2 bathrooms (including ensuite)\r\n- Easy-care, single-level design\r\n- Brand new and ready to enjoy\r\n- Affordable entry into a sought-after area\r\n\r\nWhether you're stepping onto the property ladder, downsizing, or investing, this is a smart move in a fast-growing neighbourhood.",
